sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PO as PurchaseOrderService
  participant ST as applyMovement
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant J as Alert job
  participant Log as Server log
  Admin->>Web: Open /inventory by typing the address, Create PO
  Web->>API: POST /purchase-orders
  API->>PO: create
  PO->>PG: PO number, lines, totals, status draft - Unverified, createdBy points to employees
  Admin->>Web: Mark as Ordered
  Web->>API: PATCH /purchase-orders/:id/status
  Admin->>Web: Receive Items, batch and expiry
  Web->>API: POST /purchase-orders/:id/receive
  API->>PO: receiveItems
  PO->>ST: PURCHASE_IN per line
  ST->>PG: stock_movements row, item stock, nearest expiry, cost price - Unverified
  Admin->>API: POST /patient-consumptions - API only, no screen
  API->>ST: CONSUMPTION per line
  ST->>PG: stock lowered, patient_consumptions saved
  J->>PG: 08:00, count low stock and expiring items
  J->>Log: warning line only, nobody is notified
